OL,3,GNEWSAParkrun cancelled after runners
OL,4,Astung by hornets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parkrun in Nottingham has been
OL,7,Ftemporarily cancelled after some
OL,8,Frunners were stung by hornets, and at
OL,9,Fleast one person went to hospital for
OL,10,Ftreatment.
OL,12,FBestwood Village Parkrun said on social
OL,13,Fmedia it had an "unexpected issue" with
OL,14,Fa number of runners being stung - "some
OL,15,Fmultiple times" - in the past two
OL,16,Fweeks.
OL,18,FOn Wednesday, organisers confirmed in
OL,19,Fan update that there was a native
OL,20,Fhornets' nest in a tree next to the
OL,21,Frunning course in Bestwood Country
OL,22,FPark.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
